  "_about": "When a pattern may be drawn, read at the string's first blow. A pattern with no row is always open. stick: the stick's direction at that press; with the stick toward, the draw is among the patterns gated to toward, and without it those are closed. ground: both fighters are on the ground. fighters: only these fighters' strings draw it",
